SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/ DANi iVORY
DESCRIPTION:CHOOSE A SONG FROM DANI’S SONG LIST \nMAKE A REQUEST HERE! \nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @Dani-Ivory Paypal: @DANiiVORY \nClassically trained singer\, pianist\, and songwriter\, Dani Ivory brings soulful vocals\, refined piano playing\, and a magnetic stage presence to every room she plays. Raised in Pittsburgh and shaped by years performing and recording in Los Angeles\, Dani’s journey has taken her from intimate piano lounges to some of the world’s biggest stages\, working as a background vocalist and keyboardist with artists including Beyoncé\, Cee Lo Green\, Imagine Dragons\, and currently Vance Joy. Now based in Nashville\, she blends pop\, soul\, country\, and timeless favorites into elevated\, interactive performances.  Follow her journey and explore her latest original music. \nIG: @daniiivory  \nFB: @daniivoryartist \n 
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-w-dani-ivory-3/2026-05-29/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Dani-Ivory-Piano-2026-scaled-e1769110452137.jpeg
END:VEVENT
